| Code                | Meaning                        | Result (for `{3,8,2,10,5}`) |
| ------------------- | ------------------------------ | --------------------------- |
| `nums.begin()`      | Iterator to first element      | Points to `3`               |
| `nums.end()`        | Iterator past the last element | Past `5`                    |
| `max_element(...)`  | Iterator to largest element    | Points to `10`              |
| `*it`               | Value at that iterator         | `10`                        |
| `it - nums.begin()` | Distance from the beginning    | `3` (the index)             |
